{
  "$schema": "./bootstrap-schema.json",
  "phase": "3",
  "description": "Class creation infrastructure - enables Smalltalk to create its own classes",
  "comments": [
    "Phase 3 Part A: Class creation via message sends",
    "Adds methods to Behavior for creating subclasses",
    "Adds methods to CompiledMethod for installing methods",
    "After this phase, the system can build itself via Smalltalk messages"
  ],
